AsyncSubject
AsyncSubject emits the last value ONLY when the stream completes,, completeMethod is needed here, only then it will give last value to thiere subscribers
whereas ReplaySubject(1) emits the last value immediately, even before completion.

This single line is the key.
2️⃣ Side-by-side behavior table
Feature	                                AsyncSubject	                 ReplaySubject(1)
Emits last value	                ✅	                        ✅
Emits before completion                	❌	                        ✅
Requires complete()	                ✅	                        ❌
Late subscribers get value	        Only after completion	        Always
Typical use	                        “Give final result only”	“Cache latest value”

3️⃣ Example 1 — AsyncSubject
const as = new AsyncSubject<number>();
as.subscribe(v => console.log('A:', v));
as.next(1);
as.next(2);
as.subscribe(v => console.log('B:', v));
as.complete();
Output
A: 2
B: 2

🔴 Important:
No emission until complete()
Only last value is emitted
All subscribers receive it at completion time

What each one really is (one-liners)
Type	                What it is
Observable	        Base stream, lazy, unicast
Subject	                Multicast Observable + Observer
BehaviorSubject	        Subject with current value
ReplaySubject	        Subject with value buffer
AsyncSubject	        Subject that emits final value on completion

========================================================================================================================================
Cold Observable (default in RxJS)
Definition (simple)

A cold observable starts producing values only when you subscribe,
and each subscriber gets its own execution.

Hot Observable
Definition (simple)
A hot observable has one shared source,
and subscribers tap into it mid-stream.

Cold observables create data per subscriber, hot observables share a single data source among all subscribers.

| Type            | Source             | Shared? | Memory         |
| --------------- | ------------------ | ------- | -------------- |
| Cold            | Inside Observable  | ❌       | Per subscriber |
| Hot             | External / Subject | ✔       | Shared         |
| BehaviorSubject | Subject            | ✔       | Last value     |
| ReplaySubject   | Subject            | ✔       | Buffer         |


