What does teardown mean?
Teardown = cleanup logic
Code that runs when a subscription is finished or cancelled

Does component destroy automatically clean observables?
⚠️ NO — this is the biggest misunderstanding
Angular destroys:
Component instance
Template
View
❌ Angular does NOT automatically unsubscribe RxJS subscriptions
(except async pipe)

Teardown is cleanup logic that releases resources when a subscription ends; Angular component destroy does not automatically unsubscribe, so manual unsubscribe is needed to avoid memory leaks.

